  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Definitional Mission - ENERGY SECTOR PROJECTS, through Energy Markets Group</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This $175,000 Definitional Mission identifies and evaluates opportunities in the energy sector in Pakistan for USTDA funding consideration. The Pakistani economy is constrained as a result of severe and unscheduled power outages of four to fifteen hours a day. This energy sector DM builds off the success of the previous energy sector DM in Pakistan that has already resulted in close to $1.7 million in USTDA funding.</narrative>
  </description>
